//github.com/Yolwoocle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yolwoocle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T15:49:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:49:40Z","body":"Great PR, although I wonder about the fact that this is disabled by default. I understand that this choice was made to preserve existing behavior, but I wonder if it would make more sense to make this enabled by default? Most games and applications *do* want it enabled by default, and I feel like the minority of applications that do want this disabled would easily find this setting. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743725953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743797304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115119#issuecomment-4743797304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115119","id":4743797304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGsCaOA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/